idos por Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/certificates",{"_58":166},"platform/pki/certificates.mdx",{"_32":168,"_39":51,"_34":134,"_45":169,"_54":-7,"_11":170,"_56":171},"es:platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx","Publica el estado de las identidades mediante OCSP y CRL.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation",{"_58":172},"platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx",{"_32":174,"_39":51,"_34":175,"_45":176,"_54":-7,"_11":177,"_56":178},"es:platform/pki/ocsp.mdx","OCSP","Consulta en tiempo real si un certificado sigue vigente o se ha revocado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/ocsp",{"_58":179},"platform/pki/ocsp.mdx",{"_32":181,"_39":51,"_34":182,"_45":183,"_54":-7,"_11":184,"_56":185},"es:platform/pki/crl.mdx","CRL","Genera y distribuye listas firmadas para validar certificados sin conexión.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/crl",{"_58":186},"platform/pki/crl.mdx",{"_32":188,"_39":51,"_34":134,"_45":189,"_54":-7,"_11":190,"_56":191},"es:platform/pki/device-enrollment.mdx","Define cómo una flota recibe, renueva y utiliza sus identidades.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment",{"_58":192},"platform/pki/device-enrollment.mdx",{"_32":194,"_39":51,"_34":195,"_45":196,"_54":-7,"_11":197,"_56":198},"es:platform/pki/est-enrollment.mdx","EST","Guía del protocolo EST en Lamassu IoT, con la configuración del DMS para el administrador PKI y la referencia de endpoints para el integrador de dispositivos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment",{"_58":199},"platform/pki/est-enrollment.mdx",{"_32":201,"_39":51,"_34":202,"_45":203,"_54":-7,"_11":204,"_56":205},"es:platform/pki/device-management.mdx","Dispositivos e identidades","Registra dispositivos y controla sus identidades durante todo el ciclo de vida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management",{"_58":206},"platform/pki/device-management.mdx",{"_32":208,"_39":51,"_34":209,"_45":210,"_54":-7,"_11":211,"_56":212},"es:platform/pki/alerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/alerts",{"_58":213},"platform/pki/alerts.mdx",{"_32":215,"_39":62,"_54":-7,"_34":216},"es:_3","Administrar Lamassu",{"_32":218,"_39":51,"_34":22,"_45":219,"_54":-7,"_11":20,"_56":220},"es:platform/pki/access-control.mdx","Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP.",{"_58":221},"platform/pki/access-control.mdx",{"_32":223,"_39":51,"_34":224,"_45":225,"_54":-7,"_11":226,"_56":227},"es:platform/pki/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs",{"_58":228},"platform/pki/audit-logs.mdx",{"_32":230,"_39":51,"_34":231,"_45":232,"_54":-7,"_11":233,"_56":234},"es:platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas","Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting",{"_58":235},"platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_32":237,"_39":62,"_54":-7,"_34":238},"es:_4","Integraciones",{"_32":240,"_39":51,"_34":241,"_45":242,"_54":-7,"_11":243,"_56":244},"es:platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_58":245},"platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform",{"_248":249},"metaFile","platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=